text = "Defend your kitchen from waves of hungry monsters!\n\n- Each wave, pick a recipe card to place towers\n- Towers automatically attack enemies in their lanes\n- Choose rooms between waves for bonuses and challenges\n- Match enemy cravings to slow them down — feeding the wrong craving enrages them!\n- Survive as many waves as possible to set a new high score"
